    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1251">

                <pb facs="0871" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/394.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Silliman to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Teoloyucan</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s August 8. General Carranza is without advices in this matter up to
                    this time. He has asked authorities at Tampico for information and
                    explanation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
